      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{6015a8dedd548068697b6112|full_name}I asked about this in the VRChat Discord server and nobody told me there was a way. But I’m still confused.\n\nWhat do you mean by globally? You mean all those avatar across VRC will be blocked for me?\n\nAnd ”user display” you’re saying is hiding that avatar on only the person you did it too?",
